<title>POLAND: DEBICA Q1 NET RISES TO PLN 19.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>DEBICA Q1 NET RISES TO PLN 19.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Debica preliminary</p>
<p>results for Q1 ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997     Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			18.48 vs    19.08</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  28.52 vs    19.32</p>
<p>    net profit				19.52 vs    12.29</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is: Firma Oponiarska Debica SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				164.94 vs   129.68</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 130.34 vs   100.71</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		    na  vs     2.07</p>
<p>    income tax				 6.34 vs     4.96</p>
<p>    other taxes				2.65 vs	na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   178.86 vs    25.52</p>
<p>    financial costs			168.82 vs    25.29</p>
<p>    investment				 6.72 vs     5.05</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
